      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Quickstart Guide\n\n1. **Build the image:**\n   `docker build -t network-topology-exporter:latest .`\n\n2. **Configure:**\n   - `cp deploy/test-harness/config.yaml.example deploy/test-harness/config.yaml` (Set CIDR)\n   - `cp deploy/test-harness/alloy/config.alloy.example deploy/test-harness/alloy/config.alloy` (Set GC credentials + `tester_id`)\n\n3. **Run:**\n   `cd deploy/test-harness && docker compose up -d`\n\n4. **Verify:**\n   Check the indicator above. Once it turns green, your data is flowing!\n\n---\n\n### Useful Links\n- [Topology Graph](./d/topology-graph)\n- [Exporter Health](./d/exporter-health)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Getting Started",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "content": "### What to expect\n\nOnce live, you should see:\n- `network_topology_device_info`: Inventory of your lab devices.\n- `network_topology_edge_info`: Links between them discovered via LLDP/CDP.\n\n### Troubleshooting\n- **Red box?** Check Alloy logs: `docker logs test-harness-alloy-1`\n- **No data?** Check Exporter metrics: `curl http://localhost:9100/metrics` on your host.\n- **Authentication issues?** Ensure your Grafana Cloud token has `metrics:write` and `logs:write` scopes.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Onboarding Help",
      "type": "text"
    }
